==Miscellaneous==
*Added 3 new [[User Rank]] rewards:
**27,100 grants +5 Uber Rare Catseyes.
**27,200 grants +5 Legend Catseyes.
**27,300 grants +5 Special Catseyes.
*Raised [[Catburger (Special Cat)|Catburger]]'s + level cap from +35 to +40.
*Raised [[Medal King (Special Cat)|Medal King]]'s + level cap from +15 to +20.
*Raised [[Scarf Cat (Special Cat)|Scarf Cat]]'s + level cap from +20 to +25.
*Added 1 new ability:
**'''Drain''' (遅延 ''Chien''): Increases recharge time of units hit. Has no effect against units that are fully recharged. This ability's effect is impacted by [[Sage Slayer]]'s passive debuff resistance and can be removed with [[Curse]].
*Lineups used to clear Level 1-3 stages are now saved separately from those used to clear Level 4 stages.
*[[:Category:Mythic Cats|Mythic Cat]] previews shown when entering [[Legend Stages]] now say the number of sub-chapters left to be cleared until you reach them, replacing the number of the "Stage Clear Reward/Bonus X" (e.g., [[Ururun Wolf (Special Cat)|Ururun Wolf]]'s preview used to say "Stage Clear Reward 1", but now says "Stage Clear Reward (X more)" initially and "Stage Clear Reward (Challenge Now!)" after reaching [[Jail Break Tunnel]]).
*All Standard and Great [[:Category:Advent Stages|Advent Stages]] have Energy Rush during [[Meownesday]].
*All [[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Galaxy Gals]] have the missing ", type" added to their Evolved Forms' names (e.g. Raclesa Σ → Raclesa, type Σ) as well having their Greek letters added to their [[True Form|True]]/[[Ultra Form]]s' names (e.g. Divine Coppermine → Divine Coppermine κ).
**Despite this, [[Kalisa (Uber Rare Cat)|Kalisa]] still doesn't have her Greek letter in her true form name, being "χ".
*Removed "Huntress" from [[Terun (Uber Rare Cat)|Terun]]'s Normal, Evolved and True Form names.
*Changed the descriptions of [[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Clan Heroes]]' Normal, Evolved and True Forms to have their targeted traits separated by slashes rather than commas.
*Fixed a background music issue where it would not loop properly on some devices.
*Renamed the Black trait to [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] in the [[The Battle Cats|English Version]], and changed several characters' names and descriptions accordingly:
