==Trivia==
*[[Bun Bun Black]] and [[Black Slug]] are the only enemies that did not have the "Black" in their name changed to "Dark" in [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] 15.3. Some other enemies' names still also contain different languages' words for black: [[Director Kurosawah]] and [[Crocodylidae Kurocroc]] have ''kuro'' (Japanese for black), while [[Le'noir]] has ''noir'' (French for black).

